A||||6||SLAMMED87GT||GT Clear Tailights!||||1||
Z||000000||SLAMMED87GT||08-26-2001||03:53 PM||||Hi People- Well, I wanted to do something unique with my tailight and I decided to cleat them out. It actually turned out pretty good. I removed the orange/red insert and cleaned up the inside of the housing really good. I polished the lenses up as well. Then I bought red and orange bulbs at $10 a piece! YES, that's right, but they are worth it. They are not dipped glass which fades and looks crappy after little usage. These are red glass. They are the typr many "rice boys" use. So after I put it all together I think it is a really cool looking light. <P>Some of you might say it's riced out but I like the looks of it and quite honestly many domestic cars are now equipped with these type of lights. <P>I will post pics as soon as I take some! <P>Later<P><P>------------------<BR>||||reg||1
